  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Urban Planning Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates analyzing urban infrastructure using OpenStreetMap (OSM) data:\n",
    "1. **OSM Data Ingestion**: Load building and street networks\n",
    "2. **Clustering Analysis**: Identify development patterns\n",
    "3. **Spatial Statistics**: Calculate density metrics\n",
    "4. **Predictive Modeling**: Forecast growth areas\n",
    "\n",
    "## Use Case\n",
    "Analyze urban sprawl and identify optimal locations for future development"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup and Configuration"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import requests\n",
    "import json\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "\n",
    "# API Configuration\n",
    "API_BASE = 'http://localhost:8080'\n",
    "headers = {'Content-Type': 'application/json'}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Authenticate\n",
    "auth_response = requests.post(\n",
    "    f'{API_BASE}/auth/login',\n",
    "    json={'username': 'admin', 'password': 'changeme'}\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "token = auth_response.json()['data']['token']\n",
    "headers['Authorization'] = f'Bearer {token}'\n",
    "\n",
    "print('✓ Authentication successful')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Load OSM Building Data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Sample OSM building data for urban area\n",
    "osm_data = {\n",
    "    \"type\": \"FeatureCollection\",\n",
    "    \"features\": [\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"type\": \"Feature\",\n",
    "            \"geometry\": {\"type\": \"Point\", \"coordinates\": [-87.65, 41.87]},\n",
    "            \"properties\": {\n",
    "                \"name\": \"Willis Tower\",\n",
    "                \"building_type\": \"commercial\",\n",
    "                \"height_m\": 442,\n",
    "                \"floors\": 110,\n",
    "                \"year_built\": 1973,\n",
    "                \"residents\": 0\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"type\": \"Feature\",\n",
    "            \"geometry\": {\"type\": \"Point\", \"coordinates\": [-87.62, 41.88]},\n",
    "            \"properties\": {\n",
    "                \"name\": \"Residential Cluster A\",\n",
    "                \"building_type\": \"residential\",\n",
    "                \"height_m\": 25,\n",
    "                \"floors\": 8,\n",
    "                \"year_built\": 2005,\n",
    "                \"residents\": 450\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"type\": \"Feature\",\n",
    "            \"geometry\": {\"type\": \"Point\", \"coordinates\": [-87.68, 41.86]},\n",
    "            \"properties\": {\n",
    "                \"name\": \"Residential Cluster B\",\n",
    "                \"building_type\": \"residential\",\n",
    "                \"height_m\": 20,\n",
    "                \"floors\": 6,\n",
    "                \"year_built\": 2010,\n",
    "                \"residents\": 320\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        },\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"type\": \"Feature\",\n",\n",
    "            \"geometry\": {\"type\": \"Point\", \"coordinates\": [-87.60, 41.89]},\n",
    "            \"properties\": {\n",\n",
    "                \"name\": \"Commercial Hub\",\n",
    "                \"building_type\": \"commercial\",\n",
    "                \"height_m\": 35,\n",
    "                \"floors\": 12,\n",
    "                \"year_built\": 2015,\n",
    "                \"residents\": 0\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Ingest OSM data\n",
    "response = requests.post(\n",
    "    f'{API_BASE}/ingest',\n",
    "    headers=headers,\n",\n",
    "    json={\n",
    "        'source': 'OpenStreetMap',\n",\n",
    "        'format': 'GeoJSON',\n",
    "        'data': osm_data\n",
    "    }\n",\n",
    ")\n",\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'✓ OSM data ingested: {response.json()[\"data\"].get(\"rows_ingested\", \"N/A\")} buildings')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Clustering Analysis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Identify building clusters (development patterns)\n",
    "cluster_response = requests.post(\n",
    "    f'{API_BASE}/analyze',\n",
    "    headers=headers,\n",\n",
    "    json={\n",\n",
    "        'operation': 'cluster_analysis',\n",\n",
    "        'params': {\n",\n",
    "            'num_clusters': 3,\n",\n",
    "            'variable': 'residents'\n",\n",
    "        }\n",\n",
    "    }\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "if cluster_response.status_code == 200:\n",\n",
    "    clusters = cluster_response.json()['data']\n",\n",
    "    print('✓ Clustering analysis completed')\n",\n",
    "    print(f'  Clusters identified: {clusters.get(\"num_clusters\", \"N/A\")}')\n",\n",
    "    print(f'  Points in clusters: {clusters.get(\"points_clustered\", \"N/A\")}')\n",\n",
    "else:\n",\n",
    "    print(f'✗ Clustering failed: {cluster_response.text}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Density Analysis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Create density heatmap\n",
    "viz_response = requests.post(\n",\n",
    "    f'{API_BASE}/visualize',\n",\n",
    "    headers=headers,\n",\n",
    "    json={\n",\n",
    "        'type': 'heatmap',\n",\n",
    "        'variable': 'residents',\n",\n",
    "        'colormap': 'YlOrRd',\n",\n",
    "        'title': 'Urban Population Density - Chicago'\n",\n",
    "    }\n",\n",\n",
    ")\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "if viz_response.status_code == 200:\n",\n",
    "    print('✓ Density heatmap created')\n",\n",
    "    print('  Shows population concentration across urban areas')\n",\n",
    "else:\n",\n",
    "    print(f'✗ Visualization failed')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Machine Learning - Growth Prediction"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Prepare features for prediction model\n",
    "features = {\n",\n",
    "    'distance_to_downtown': [2.5, 1.8, 3.2, 1.2],\n",
    "    'road_density': [8.5, 9.2, 7.8, 10.1],\n",\n",
    "    'current_population': [450, 320, 0, 0],\n",\n",
    "    'proximity_to_transit': [0.8, 0.6, 0.9, 0.5]\n",\n",
    "}\n",\n",
    "\n",
n",
    "targets = [1, 1, 0, 1]  # 1 = high growth area, 0 = low growth\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "# Train random forest model\n",\n",
    "ml_response = requests.post(\n",\n",
    "    f'{API_BASE}/predict',\n",\n",
    "    headers=headers,\n",\n",
    "    json={\n",\n",
    "        'model_id': 'urban_growth_rf',\n",\n",
    "        'features': features,\n",\n",
    "        'algorithm': 'random_forest'\n",\n",
    "    }\n",\n",
    ")\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "if ml_response.status_code == 200:\n",\n",
    "    predictions = ml_response.json()['data']\n",\n",
    "    print('✓ Growth prediction model trained')\n",\n",
    "    print(f'  Model accuracy: {predictions.get(\"accuracy\", \"N/A\")}')\n",\n",
    "    print('  Can now predict growth potential for new areas')\n",\n",
    "else:\n",\n",
    "    print(f'✗ Model training failed')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Recommendations"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "recommendations = {\n",
    "    \"high_growth_zones\": [\n",
    "        {\n",\n",
    "            \"location\": \"North downtown corridor\",\n",\n",
    "            \"reason\": \"High transit accessibility + existing infrastructure\",\n",\n",
    "            \"growth_potential\": \"Very High\"\n",\n",
    "        },\n",\n",
    "        {\n",\n",
    "            \"location\": \"Residential expansion areas\",\n",\n",
    "            \"reason\": \"Lower density + good road connectivity\",\n",\n",
    "            \"growth_potential\": \"High\"\n",\n",
    "        }\n",\n",
    "    ],\n",\n",
    "    \"development_recommendations\": [\n",\n",
    "        \"Prioritize transit-oriented development\",\n",\n",
    "        \"Enhance road network in growth zones\",\n",\n",
    "        \"Preserve green spaces in developed areas\"\n",\n",
    "    ]\n",\n",
    "}\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "print('Development Recommendations:')\n",\n",
    "print(json.dumps(recommendations, indent=2))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Summary\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "### Analysis Results\n",\n",
    "✓ Building data ingested from OSM\n",\n",
    "✓ Development clusters identified (3 main clusters)\n",\n",
    "✓ Population density heatmap created\n",\n",
    "✓ Growth prediction model trained\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "### Key Insights\n",\n",
    "- Downtown and corridors show highest density\n",
    "- High growth potential in transit-accessible areas\n",
    "- Residential and commercial clustering patterns clear\n",\n",
    "\n",\n",
    "### Next Steps\n",\n",
    "- Apply zoning regulations analysis\n",\n",
    "- Model infrastructure capacity\n",\n",
    "- Plan sustainable development pathways"
   ]
  }
